    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joltt \u2013 Battle Pillars is a new kind of 2D fighting game where wizards duel in magical jousts. Victory isn\u2019t about depleting your opponent\u2019s health, but making them fall from their pillar. Outmaneuver their attacks and knock them off with your magical projectiles to be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/85a4fecbef76cc1708e16d11c58578ea.poster.avif?t=1753955469\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/85a4fecbef76cc1708e16d11c58578ea.webm?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/85a4fecbef76cc1708e16d11c58578ea.mp4?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no blocking in Joltt.\u00a0Read your opponent\u2019s mind, dodge, evade and counter everything to be victorious!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online Ranked &amp; Casual Match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local VS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode (do whatever you can to survive a huge wave of incoming projectiles)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Training Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/d73d4f680ce2902e9df34c895a851430.poster.avif?t=1753955469\" width=634 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/d73d4f680ce2902e9df34c895a851430.webm?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/d73d4f680ce2902e9df34c895a851430.mp4?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn and master 6 different wizards, each having a vastly different gameplay!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ell uses powerful feints and casts multiple projectiles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alsnad has great control over the speed of his projectiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xioko uses the power of the wind and can fly freely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Braboz summons unpredictable portals and can teleport around the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Myra has access to different modes by igniting her sword with colored flames.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okhpum has to summon spirits to gain access to his most powerful moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first one to fill up your super bar and unleash your devastating super move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No complicated inputs. No execution required. All powers are cast with a simple button press, sometimes associated with a direction. You\u2019ll go straight into the mind games without passing hours in the training room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/f95ef1fdeda0bdf01b4b098da7aad3d5.poster.avif?t=1753955469\" width=702 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/f95ef1fdeda0bdf01b4b098da7aad3d5.webm?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/f95ef1fdeda0bdf01b4b098da7aad3d5.mp4?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.poster.avif?t=1753955469\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.webm?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.mp4?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
