\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/f95ef1fdeda0bdf01b4b098da7aad3d5.mp4?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.poster.avif?t=1753955469\" width=616 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.webm?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353130/extras/1a4229ca42aaae70715f92fcf75be531.mp4?t=1753955469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
